<view class="page points-page"><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="state-panel"><view class="state-icon"><t-loading size="48rpx"/></view><text class="state-title">正在加载积分</text></view><view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="state-panel state-error"><text class="state-title">积分加载失败</text><text class="state-copy">{{error}}</text><button class="secondary" bindtap="load">重新加载</button></view><block wx:elif="{{points}}"><view class="points-hero"><text class="hero-label">累计安全积分</text><text class="hero-value">{{points.total}}</text><view class="hero-row"><text>本月 {{points.monthPoints}} 分</text><text>今日 {{points.todayPoints}} 分</text></view></view><view class="screen-tabs"><view class="screen-tab {{tab==='summary'?'screen-tab-active':''}}" data-tab="summary" bindtap="switchTab">积分概览</view><view class="screen-tab {{tab==='rules'?'screen-tab-active':''}}" data-tab="rules" bindtap="switchTab">积分规则</view></view><view wx:if="{{tab==='summary'}}" class="card"><text class="title">本月积分</text><text class="points-number">{{points.monthPoints}}</text><text class="muted">当前接口提供积分汇总。逐笔积分流水尚未开放时，不会用客户端数据伪造明细。</text><button class="secondary" bindtap="openLeaderboard">查看本月排行榜</button></view><view wx:else class="card rules"><view class="rule-row"><view class="rule-number">1</view><text>每日安全挑战固定抽取最多 5 道已启用题目。</text></view><view class="rule-row"><view class="rule-number">2</view><text>每题首次回答正确得 2 分，答错不扣分。</text></view><view class="rule-row"><view class="rule-number">3</view><text>每日最多获得 10 分；重复作答不重复计分。</text></view><view class="rule-row"><view class="rule-number">4</view><text>积分仅用于安全知识激励，不作为培训完成或上岗资格依据。</text></view></view></block></view><environment-badge />
